1
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:17,420
Tu veux acheter ce livre ?
Do you want to buy this book?

2
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:21,860
Oui. Combien coûte ce livre ?
Yes. How much does this book cost?

3
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:24,932
Le prix est de dix euros.
The price is ten euros.

4
00:00:25,032 --> 00:00:32,468
C'est un peu cher. J'ai de l'argent. Je peux payer par carte ?
It's a little expensive. I have money. Can I pay by card?

5
00:00:32,568 --> 00:00:36,620
Oui, le paiement par carte est possible.
Yes, payment by card is possible.

6
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:42,164
Alors, je paie par carte. Et ce stylo ?
Then, I'll pay by card. And this pen?

7
00:00:42,264 --> 00:00:44,924
Il coûte un euro.
It costs one euro.

8
00:00:45,024 --> 00:00:50,084
Parfait, je prends les deux. Merci !
Perfect, I'll take both. Thanks!
